WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.050
Safex

00:00:07.891 --> 00:00:12.624
Two stowaways

00:00:19.169 --> 00:00:27.042
With the help of captain Justin, Candy
sneaked into the freighter ship successfully.

00:00:30.814 --> 00:00:37.219
Taking her loved pet,
she left England for America.

00:01:18.562 --> 00:01:21.326
We can breathe now!

00:01:22.365 --> 00:01:24.333
Kurin, cheer up!

00:01:30.006 --> 00:01:33.134
Be quiet! Are you a stowaway?

00:01:33.577 --> 00:01:38.810
If I got caught,
they'll send me back to England.

00:01:40.984 --> 00:01:42.417
Calm down!

00:01:43.019 --> 00:01:45.510
You will be found.

00:01:45.822 --> 00:01:48.222
I know this voice!

00:01:51.862 --> 00:01:55.059
The cry of a raccoon? You...

00:02:02.873 --> 00:02:06.104
Cookie! You're Cookie!

00:02:07.077 --> 00:02:08.305
Hi!

00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:11.740
Don't frighten me!

00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:13.305
I was frightened too.

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:15.814
We'll be found if we talk loudly.

00:02:17.687 --> 00:02:21.149
Did you slip in here secretly too?

00:02:21.299 --> 00:02:23.658
You can say that!

00:02:24.961 --> 00:02:31.025
That's great! It's so dark here.

00:02:39.843 --> 00:02:42.107
We must speak in low voice in here.

00:02:44.814 --> 00:02:49.979
If the sailors found us,
we'd be in trouble.

00:02:50.553 --> 00:02:53.044
You know lot about the ship.

00:02:53.823 --> 00:02:55.916
I want to be a sailor.

00:02:57.027 --> 00:03:01.327
You do have courage for a little girl,
to dare to cross the ocean.

00:03:02.198 --> 00:03:05.126
I must return to America.

00:03:05.276 --> 00:03:08.196
Are your parents all in America?

00:03:08.346 --> 00:03:13.134
No, I don't have parents.

00:03:13.284 --> 00:03:15.143
Me neither.

00:03:19.082 --> 00:03:20.743
Thanks!

00:03:21.184 --> 00:03:23.652
My father was a sailor as well.

00:03:24.054 --> 00:03:27.956
I have decided to be a sailor
since childhood.

00:03:29.759 --> 00:03:33.456
The way he speaks is really like Terry.

00:03:39.803 --> 00:03:41.296
After my mother's death...

00:03:41.446 --> 00:03:45.603
In order to be a sailor,
I had been smuggled many times.

00:03:45.875 --> 00:03:48.403
It's not your first time?

00:03:48.553 --> 00:03:51.572
Right! Probably ten times.

00:03:52.649 --> 00:03:54.310
So many...

00:03:56.353 --> 00:03:59.618
But, I never succeeded,
I always get caught.

00:04:00.256 --> 00:04:02.190
What would happen if we got caught?

00:04:02.692 --> 00:04:05.058
We'll be hanged or repatriated.

00:04:05.695 --> 00:04:07.322
Hanged?!

00:04:10.867 --> 00:04:12.266
Someone's coming!

00:04:26.082 --> 00:04:28.812
How about it? Any damage?

00:04:33.456 --> 00:04:34.482
OK!

00:04:34.632 --> 00:04:35.684
Check carefully!

00:04:35.834 --> 00:04:38.319
If the rope is broken, we'll be trouble.

00:04:58.748 --> 00:05:00.215
Strange!

00:05:12.495 --> 00:05:14.190
Check-off!

00:05:22.038 --> 00:05:23.932
My heart almost stopped!

00:05:24.082 --> 00:05:27.966
How can you reach to America like that?

00:05:28.545 --> 00:05:30.775
You're young but brave.

00:05:31.448 --> 00:05:33.814
I'm 15 already!

00:05:34.417 --> 00:05:35.941
Me too.

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:38.947
I thought that you are younger than I.

00:05:39.097 --> 00:05:40.546
Me too.

00:05:43.693 --> 00:05:47.993
Not looking like 15,
that's a trouble for me.

00:05:49.966 --> 00:05:54.835
The companies of the ship here
don't hire the children to be a sailor.

00:05:55.171 --> 00:05:57.932
That's why you want to go to America?

00:05:58.082 --> 00:06:03.843
If I were in America,
they'd hire me to be a sailor for sure.

00:06:05.849 --> 00:06:07.578
What happened?

00:06:09.486 --> 00:06:11.716
Saying ''hello'' to other ships.

00:06:31.841 --> 00:06:33.741
The conversation is so simple.

00:06:34.577 --> 00:06:38.138
The decks are definitely very noisy.

00:06:38.615 --> 00:06:44.747
It's so dark inside
If Cookie wouldn't be at my side...

00:06:59.435 --> 00:07:01.403
I'm hungry!

00:07:03.239 --> 00:07:06.003
How can you be like that?

00:07:09.746 --> 00:07:12.044
I'm hungry too.

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:16.344
Candy,
I'll go find food in storeroom.

00:07:16.494 --> 00:07:17.977
Is it all right?

00:07:21.257 --> 00:07:24.351
It is dinner time now!

00:07:27.297 --> 00:07:28.958
Be careful!

00:07:29.666 --> 00:07:31.566
Wait and look!

00:07:43.146 --> 00:07:44.545
Behave yourself!

00:07:45.248 --> 00:07:47.709
Excuse me for coming late.

00:07:47.859 --> 00:07:49.547
What's that in your pocket?

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:52.586
Take it out!

00:07:54.591 --> 00:07:56.320
Where did you get the apple?

00:07:57.694 --> 00:07:58.991
An old trick!

00:08:00.029 --> 00:08:03.958
It's captain's dessert.

00:08:04.108 --> 00:08:05.126
You are lying!

00:08:05.276 --> 00:08:08.897
Only I and the cook
have the storeroom key!

00:08:09.047 --> 00:08:11.634
-Right?
-Yes.

00:08:12.542 --> 00:08:14.936
Viva, did you steal the key?

00:08:15.086 --> 00:08:17.705
No, I found it in the cabin just now.

00:08:17.855 --> 00:08:18.740
Really?

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:20.248
Yes.

00:08:21.184 --> 00:08:23.243
Go search!

00:08:23.586 --> 00:08:25.213
Let’s go!

00:08:33.363 --> 00:08:36.025
The storeroom is locked.

00:08:44.407 --> 00:08:45.431
Cookie!

00:08:46.075 --> 00:08:47.042
No!

00:08:47.644 --> 00:08:50.909
Damn it! Slipped up again!
Get him!

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:55.708
Stop!

00:08:59.589 --> 00:09:01.523
Cookie has been found!

00:09:03.626 --> 00:09:06.220
What are you doing? Release me!

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:08.829
Release me!

00:09:09.299 --> 00:09:11.125
I want to be a sailor.

00:09:11.275 --> 00:09:12.827
Children cannot become sailors.

00:09:12.977 --> 00:09:14.301
Behave yourself!

00:09:14.837 --> 00:09:16.930
I would rather die than give up.

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:18.573
Let go of me!

00:09:22.178 --> 00:09:26.407
I’d like to help Cookie,
but I'm afraid of being found.

00:09:26.557 --> 00:09:28.076
Stop the ship!

00:09:28.226 --> 00:09:30.711
I must go to America.

00:09:31.854 --> 00:09:34.118
Everybody!
Throw Cookie into the sea!

00:09:35.224 --> 00:09:36.618
Throw Cookie into the sea?

00:09:36.768 --> 00:09:38.058
Let go of me!

00:09:40.196 --> 00:09:41.220
Stop it!

00:09:48.938 --> 00:09:49.996
Help!

00:09:52.175 --> 00:09:54.143
Cookie, how are you feeling?

00:09:55.178 --> 00:09:56.975
Is the brain sober?

00:09:58.147 --> 00:09:59.978
He looks like a baggage!

00:10:06.022 --> 00:10:07.114
Step aside!

00:10:07.857 --> 00:10:09.119
Cookie!

00:10:09.459 --> 00:10:10.790
You're...

00:10:11.427 --> 00:10:15.557
Don't just stand there,
he'll get drowned.

00:10:18.835 --> 00:10:20.132
Cookie!

00:10:22.171 --> 00:10:24.036
Candy!

00:10:33.783 --> 00:10:34.772
Do your best!

00:10:35.351 --> 00:10:37.945
Cookie! Swim back to England!

00:10:38.354 --> 00:10:42.051
How cruel of you!
Rescue him quick!

00:10:43.159 --> 00:10:45.820
He is very good at swimming.

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:48.022
Do you best, Cookie!

00:10:48.364 --> 00:10:49.724
Cookie!

00:10:49.874 --> 00:10:51.266
Help!

00:10:53.369 --> 00:10:54.996
My foot has pulled a muscle!

00:10:55.671 --> 00:10:57.036
He's in trouble!

00:10:59.008 --> 00:11:00.068
Back!

00:11:00.218 --> 00:11:04.910
There's no time,
Cookie may get heart problems!

00:11:05.415 --> 00:11:06.374
Heart problems?

00:11:06.524 --> 00:11:08.974
Go save him now!

00:11:09.252 --> 00:11:11.186
-Do your best!
-Hurry up!

00:11:15.091 --> 00:11:16.351
Bring me a rope.

00:11:16.501 --> 00:11:17.723
Rope.

00:11:22.098 --> 00:11:24.123
Cheer up! Hold me tight!

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:27.498
I have not practiced for a long time.

00:11:29.138 --> 00:11:30.196
Set!

00:11:34.477 --> 00:11:36.104
Miss, you are good.

00:11:36.254 --> 00:11:38.339
Stop the nonsense, just help me.

00:11:38.489 --> 00:11:40.609
Grasp it! Pull...

00:11:45.054 --> 00:11:47.045
Almost there!

00:11:49.692 --> 00:11:50.989
Hold there.

00:11:53.095 --> 00:11:54.585
Cookie!

00:11:58.000 --> 00:11:59.763
Why did you want to hurt him?

00:12:01.003 --> 00:12:02.766
We were just kidding.

00:12:03.539 --> 00:12:06.303
Cookie,
I'm Candy, can you hear me?

00:12:06.943 --> 00:12:10.872
Take him to bed
and go find some blankets.

00:12:11.022 --> 00:12:12.039
Do as doctor said.

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:18.012
Don't be rude! He is not luggage!

00:12:18.162 --> 00:12:19.850
Easy!

00:12:20.089 --> 00:12:21.149
Brother!

00:12:21.299 --> 00:12:22.248
What?

00:12:23.059 --> 00:12:27.052
I was wondering
who is that young lady?

00:12:27.463 --> 00:12:29.158
You don't know her?

00:12:30.032 --> 00:12:33.027
Could she be the captain's daughter?

00:12:33.177 --> 00:12:36.629
The captain do has a daughter alright,
but...

00:12:37.006 --> 00:12:39.566
You over there!
Give me some warm milk.

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:43.137
Just like captain!

00:12:53.756 --> 00:12:56.350
You're back, Cookie.

00:12:59.028 --> 00:13:02.355
Don't worry, you will be warm up soon!

00:13:02.505 --> 00:13:05.193
Candy, how can you come out?

00:13:05.343 --> 00:13:07.998
You're a stowaway!

00:13:08.404 --> 00:13:10.097
I forgot!

00:13:10.247 --> 00:13:11.532
Hide quickly.

00:13:11.682 --> 00:13:12.835
Where can I hide?

00:13:13.976 --> 00:13:15.336
Hot milk is coming!

00:13:15.486 --> 00:13:16.604
-Candy!
-Lie down...

00:13:16.754 --> 00:13:18.704
Cookie, you are a victim.

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:23.543
Keep pretending...

00:13:26.088 --> 00:13:28.784
You can't die! Cookie!

00:13:30.693 --> 00:13:32.957
Bring more blankets!

00:13:34.897 --> 00:13:36.922
Was it so bad, lady?

00:13:37.867 --> 00:13:39.334
Lady?

00:13:40.436 --> 00:13:44.966
We wouldn't do that
if we knew that he is your friend.

00:13:45.116 --> 00:13:48.238
If Cookie loses his life,
you'll probably get hanged.

00:13:48.444 --> 00:13:49.704
Hanged?

00:13:49.854 --> 00:13:52.509
I told you before,
the ship needs a doctor.

00:13:52.682 --> 00:13:56.812
Isn't that the owner's responsibility?

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:02.958
Quiet! Everyone...

00:14:04.427 --> 00:14:08.864
Leave it to me! I am a nurse.

00:14:11.701 --> 00:14:13.498
That would be great!

00:14:13.736 --> 00:14:14.996
Are you a nurse?

00:14:15.146 --> 00:14:20.008
The captain's daughter
is a gentle nurse.

00:14:20.576 --> 00:14:22.703
Captain's daughter?

00:14:23.145 --> 00:14:26.046
That's why they didn't stop me.

00:14:26.349 --> 00:14:29.250
The captain will find that
sooner or later.

00:14:33.389 --> 00:14:36.051
Is there anything to eat?

00:14:36.592 --> 00:14:39.060
A dying patient can eat?

00:14:40.429 --> 00:14:44.126
The easily digestible food
and some fruits.

00:14:44.767 --> 00:14:46.127
Right away!

00:14:46.277 --> 00:14:50.104
Leave everything to me,
please go back to your room.

00:14:50.539 --> 00:14:53.099
Sorry to trouble you, lady!

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:59.511
Daughter?

00:15:01.350 --> 00:15:03.443
Your lovely daughter.

00:15:06.022 --> 00:15:07.582
Daughter?

00:15:07.732 --> 00:15:09.352
You want to see her here?

00:15:10.493 --> 00:15:13.223
No! Just get back to your duties.

00:15:16.666 --> 00:15:18.190
Daughter...

00:15:31.981 --> 00:15:33.141
Delicious!

00:15:34.150 --> 00:15:35.344
So delicious!

00:15:36.852 --> 00:15:39.714
We will make it this time.

00:15:39.864 --> 00:15:42.149
But the captain...

00:15:42.299 --> 00:15:46.754
We're far already,
how can he take us back to England?

00:15:46.904 --> 00:15:48.990
We're now
in the middle of Atlantic Ocean.

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:52.228
And, there's tsunami around here.

00:15:52.468 --> 00:15:54.265
You know that too?

00:15:55.071 --> 00:15:57.437
I am good at smuggling.

00:16:09.185 --> 00:16:11.153
I am captain Neiben.

00:16:11.954 --> 00:16:14.514
I am Candy.

00:16:15.057 --> 00:16:18.584
Finish your meals and get some sleep.

00:16:19.095 --> 00:16:20.585
Thank you very much!

00:16:20.796 --> 00:16:25.995
Tomorrow morning,
you'll be going back to England.

00:16:26.402 --> 00:16:31.465
Captain, it's the middle of the Atlantic
Ocean, you want us to go back to England?

00:16:31.615 --> 00:16:35.030
There's ship back to England at dawn.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:38.578
She'll take you back.

00:16:39.181 --> 00:16:40.614
Captain!

00:16:43.018 --> 00:16:44.383
Please wait!

00:16:45.554 --> 00:16:49.183
I'm sorry that
we snuck onto your ship.

00:16:49.333 --> 00:16:54.088
Please don't send us back,
I must return to America.

00:16:54.238 --> 00:16:57.997
Captain,
I will become a sailor in America.

00:16:59.001 --> 00:17:01.231
Is your name Candy?

00:17:04.039 --> 00:17:05.966
Did anyone help you?

00:17:06.116 --> 00:17:10.905
Who is the guy who helped you?
Tell me the truth.

00:17:11.055 --> 00:17:12.174
Nobody!

00:17:12.615 --> 00:17:15.175
This isn't a passenger liner.

00:17:15.751 --> 00:17:21.451
There is no free lunch here,
everyone on the ship must work.

00:17:22.691 --> 00:17:29.119
I detest the kind of people
who gain with no pain.

00:17:30.199 --> 00:17:31.771
Captain!

00:17:31.921 --> 00:17:34.961
You'll be sent to another room.

00:17:35.638 --> 00:17:37.037
Please wait!

00:17:54.023 --> 00:17:55.752
The room is so rotten.

00:17:56.559 --> 00:17:58.165
It's better than the cargo cabin.

00:17:58.315 --> 00:18:00.854
The captain is so stubborn.

00:18:01.063 --> 00:18:03.991
What the captain said is right.

00:18:04.141 --> 00:18:05.626
Candy!

00:18:05.776 --> 00:18:11.162
In order to go back to America,
I sneaked into this ship.

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:14.335
It's because
we can't find a job on the ship.

00:18:14.485 --> 00:18:18.642
I don't understand your situation,
I never request anyone to help me.

00:18:20.249 --> 00:18:22.109
What should we do, Candy?

00:18:22.259 --> 00:18:26.013
We will be sent back to England
tomorrow morning.

00:18:26.163 --> 00:18:28.955
It's all captain's fault.

00:18:34.196 --> 00:18:36.061
Eleanor Baker.

00:18:36.765 --> 00:18:38.995
The picture of Terry's mother.

00:18:40.302 --> 00:18:43.965
How's Terry doing in America?

00:18:45.174 --> 00:18:46.835
Do you know her?

00:18:47.042 --> 00:18:51.570
Eleanor Baker,
hottest actress in America.

00:18:54.149 --> 00:18:57.312
I saw her before, the eyes...

00:18:58.087 --> 00:18:59.180
You really did.

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:03.624
Eleanor Baker is Terry's mother.

00:19:05.661 --> 00:19:07.322
The expression in her eyes...

00:19:31.253 --> 00:19:35.115
The image here, it's so Familiar.

00:19:35.265 --> 00:19:37.920
Yes, The Michigan lake.

00:20:14.363 --> 00:20:16.490
Sister Pony, sister Lane

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:20.968
I will be sent back to England
in the morning.

00:20:25.874 --> 00:20:28.001
I'm sorry, Candy.

00:20:29.144 --> 00:20:31.044
It's not your fault.

00:20:35.751 --> 00:20:38.379
I play worse than Terry.

00:21:07.649 --> 00:21:11.983
The ship advances in the ocean.

00:21:12.988 --> 00:21:21.657
Candy prays that...
may the sun will never rise.
